" aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend><ul id="wpforms-148-field_44" class="wpforms-field-required"><li class="choice-1 depth-1"><input type="checkbox" id="wpforms-148-field_44_1" name="wpforms[fields][44][]" value="Si" aria-errormessage="wpforms-148-field_44_1-error" required ><label class="wpforms-field-label-inline" for="wpforms-148-field_44_1">Si</label></li><li class="choice-2 depth-1"><input type="checkbox" id="wpforms-148-field_44_2" name="wpforms[fields][44][]" value="No" aria-errormessage="wpforms-148-field_44_2-error" required ><label class="wpforms-field-label-inline" for="wpforms-148-field_44_2">No</label></li></ul></fieldset></div><div id="wpforms-148-field_46-container" class="wpforms-field wpforms-field-text" data-field-id="46"><label class="wpforms-field-label" for="wpforms-148-field_46">Si conoces a algún socio, indícalo para que sea tu guía en tu inicio en la asociación.</label><input type="text" id="wpforms-148-field_46" class="wpforms-field-medium" name="wpforms[fields][46]" aria-errormessage="wpforms-148-field_46-error" aria-describedby="wpforms-148-field_46-description" ><div id="wpforms-148-field_46-description" class="wpforms-field-description">Si no conoces a nadie, déjalo en blanco y te asignaremos un compañero para resolver las dudas que te puedan surgir las primeras semanas.</div></div><div id="wpforms-148-field_40-container" class="wpforms-field wpforms-field-checkbox wpforms-list-inline" data-field-id="40"><fieldset><legend class="wpforms-field-label">Aceptación de Reglamento, Estatutos y Política de Privacidad. <span class="wpforms-required-label" aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend><ul id="wpforms-148-field_40" class="wpforms-field-required"><li class="choice-1 depth-1"><input type="checkbox" id="wpforms-148-field_40_1" name="wpforms[fields][40][]" value="Acepto y declaro conocer estos documentos de la asociación." aria-errormessage="wpforms-148-field_40_1-error" aria-describedby="wpforms-148-field_40-description" required ><label clas