<p> </p></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-3k82r0nvc one-fourth tablet-one-fourth laptop-one-fourth mobile-one animate mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one-fourth" data-laptop-col="laptop-one-fourth" data-tablet-col="tablet-one-fourth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""  data-anim-type="fadeInLeft" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-3k82r0nvc mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-jhwhr8zyr one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_heading vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-jhwhr8zyr mcb-item-heading-inner"><h2 class="title"><span style="border-bottom: solid #F0A44A 8px;">2</span> </h2></div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-uabuqfrd one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_heading vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-uabuqfrd mcb-item-heading-inner"><h4 class="title">Esperar Contestación</h4></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-can7vmt1d three-fourth tablet-three-fourth laptop-three-fourth mobile-one animate mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="three-fourth" data-laptop-col="laptop-three-fourth" data-tablet-col="tablet-three-fourth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""  data-anim-type="fadeInRight" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-can7vmt1d mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-41ywu6qlq one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_column vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-41ywu6qlq mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style=""><h4>Espera nuestra confirmación de plaza</h4>

<p data-start="0" data-end="210">
  Tras recibir tu petición de alta, revisaremos la disponibilidad y nos pondremos en contacto contigo para confirmarte si hay plazas libres y cuáles son los siguientes pasos.
</p>

<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td style="vertical-align:top; padding:8px 12px;">
        Te enviaremos nuestro <strong>número de cuenta</strong> para que realices la <strong>transferencia de la primera mensualidad</strong>. Con ese pago podrás <strong>confirmar tu reserva de plaza</strong> y continuar con el proceso de alta.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>


</div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-zk77yuzo one-fourth tablet-one-fourth laptop-one-fourth mobile-one animate mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one-fourth" data-laptop-col="laptop-one-fourth" data-tablet-col="tablet-one-fourth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""  data-anim-type="fadeInLeft" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-zk77yuzo mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-b4arepuz9 one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_heading vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-b4arepuz9 mcb-item-heading-inner"><h2 class="title"><span style="border-bottom: solid #F0A44A 8px;">3</span> </h2></div></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-2ify86unb one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_heading vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-2ify86unb mcb-item-heading-inner"><h4 class="title">Confirmación de alta</h4></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-m9gmh5q39 three-fourth tablet-three-fourth laptop-three-fourth mobile-one animate mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="three-fourth" data-laptop-col="laptop-three-fourth" data-tablet-col="tablet-three-fourth" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""  data-anim-type="fadeInRight" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-m9gmh5q39 mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-zc235jp2 one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_column vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-zc235jp2 mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style=""><h4>¡Bienvenido/a!</h4>
<p data-start="18" data-end="176">Una vez verificados los datos de tu formulario y confirmado el pago de la transferencia, te contactaremos por <strong data-start="128" data-end="148">WhatsApp o email</strong> para darte la bienvenida.</p>
<p data-start="178" data-end="340">Te asignaremos un <strong data-start="196" data-end="215">número de socio</strong> y te enviaremos las instrucciones para acceder a nuestro sistema privado de gestión de partidas en el <strong data-start="318" data-end="337">Dragones del Norte</strong>.</p>

<p> </p></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-y9abcuca5 one tablet-one laptop-one mobile-one animate mfn-nested-wrap vb-item clearfix" data-desktop-col="one" data-laptop-col="laptop-one" data-tablet-col="tablet-one" data-mobile-col="mobile-one" style=""  data-anim-type="zoomIn" ><div class="mcb-wrap-inner mcb-wrap-inner-y9abcuca5 mfn-module-wrapper mfn-wrapper-for-wraps"  ><div class="mcb-wrap-background-overlay"></div><div  class="column mcb-column mcb-item-d1193cmhb one laptop-one tablet-one mobile-one column_column vb-item" style="" ><div class="mcb-column-inner mfn-module-wrapper mcb-column-inner-d1193cmhb mcb-item-column-inner"><div class="column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix" style=""><h4>Revisión de altas</h4>
<p data-start="0" data-end="209">Nuestro equipo de duendes, que gestiona las altas entre partida y partida, revisará tu solicitud lo antes posible. Ten en cuenta que podemos tardar unos días en responderte, pero no te preocupes, lo haremos.</p>
<p data-start="211" data-end="315" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Si tienes cualquier duda, no dudes en escribirnos a través del formulario de la <strong data-start="291" data-end="314">sección de contacto</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="section mcb-section the_content no_content"><div class="section_wrapper"><div class="the_content_wrapper "></div></div></section>
